"""Scheduler V4 best-trade allocator.

This module is pure production-code integration surface: it ranks a full
decision window across new candidates, open positions, pending orders,
same-symbol lifecycle alternatives, stale exposure actions, and zero-trade.
It deliberately does not import MT5, call brokers, mutate orders, call paid
APIs, or start remote/VPS work. Runtime callers can consume its selected option
as local allocation authority while broker mutation remains owned by execution.
"""

